1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,760
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,472
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,168
♪You really love me♪

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,008
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:07,024 --> 00:00:08,730
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,192
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,696
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,712 --> 00:00:15,260
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,100
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,656
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,688 --> 00:00:20,540
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:22,192
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:23,776
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,280
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,660
=The One=

16
00:00:29,712 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 9=

17
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,119
Now that's a feisty one.

18
00:00:34,439 --> 00:00:35,560
Come have some fun with us,

19
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,600
and we'll let your boy toy go.

20
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,479
I'd like to see you try.

21
00:00:43,439 --> 00:00:45,520
Gang fighting and harassing others

22
00:00:45,799 --> 00:00:46,719
are against the law.

23
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:49,119
You could be detained for ten days.

24
00:00:49,119 --> 00:00:49,759
At worst,

25
00:00:49,759 --> 00:00:50,799
you could end up in jail.

26
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,960
Who here hasn't been?

27
00:00:56,799 --> 00:00:57,840
Get her!

28
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,000
Hei Lin!

29
00:01:05,439 --> 00:01:07,079
How dare you break the rules here?

30
00:01:09,159 --> 00:01:09,760
Get out.

31
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:10,920
Let's go.

32
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,439
Are you okay?

33
00:01:12,439 --> 00:01:13,200
Does it hurt?

34
00:01:13,719 --> 00:01:14,760
Are you hurt anywhere?

35
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,319
L-let's go see Dr. Wen.

36
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:18,239
Call her. Let's go see her now.

37
00:01:18,239 --> 00:01:18,599
Come on.

38
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:19,319
I'm fine.

39
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:20,560
No need.

40
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:21,680
Then...

41
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,359
Was all that really necessary?

42
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,480
Your sugar mama is fine.

43
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,879
You're the one getting worked up.

44
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,319
Who's getting worked up?

45
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:30,640
You little punk.

46
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:31,920
Does it hurt?

47
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,879
Are you sure you're not hurt?

48
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:34,560
Huh?

49
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,120
Su Yan.

50
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,680
Are you sure you're okay?

51
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,519
You're the one who's hurt.

52
00:01:50,719 --> 00:01:51,359
(It's the weekend.)

53
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:52,640
(Are you still working overtime?)

54
00:01:57,439 --> 00:01:58,120
Su Yan.

55
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,519
What a coincidence.

56
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,960
(Shameless.)

57
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,680
(How dare you seduce my man?)

58
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:14,680
(You're asking for it.)

59
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,199
(Shameless!)

60
00:02:17,919 --> 00:02:19,560
(I'll expose you!)

61
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:22,380
(Mrs. Ge, Professor Ge's wife)

62
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,159
(Shameless!)

63
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:25,759
(I'll expose you!)

64
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:28,599
Su Yan.

65
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:30,000
Where are your manners?

66
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,360
You don't even greet Mrs. Ge?

67
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,840
Long time no see, Su Yan.

68
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:39,479
I heard

69
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:41,199
you're a top lawyer now.

70
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,960
You've done well for yourself.

71
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,879
My husband

72
00:02:45,879 --> 00:02:47,159
talks about you all the time.

73
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:49,120
He still says

74
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,479
you were his favorite student.

75
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,599
That's right.

76
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,479
Su Yan wouldn't be where she is today...

77
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:54,039
Sorry.

78
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,120
I need to use the restroom.

79
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,560
Tell me.

80
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:24,120
What if the entire legal community knew

81
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:26,159
you slept with my husband to get ahead?

82
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,319
What would happen then?

83
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,120
Back then,

84
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:35,840
he forced himself on me.

85
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:39,439
Then why didn't you report him?

86
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,759
Why didn't you speak up?

87
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,680
Without my husband,

88
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,919
would you have graduated with top marks?

89
00:03:44,319 --> 00:03:45,639
Would you have gotten a recommendation

90
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,719
for a top law firm internship?

91
00:03:46,719 --> 00:03:48,000
I earned everything I have

92
00:03:48,159 --> 00:03:49,280
through my own hard work.

93
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,120
So, hotshot lawyer,

94
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,039
where's your proof?

95
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,560
You got the guts?

96
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,080
Don't be scared.

97
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,400
I'm here.

98
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,000
You can't even stand up
to your own husband,

99
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,560
and you're taking it out on the victim?

100
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,920
You're even worse than he is.

101
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:21,879
Who are you?

102
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,879
I-I'm calling the police!

103
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,240
Cheng Lin, let go.

104
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,879
Mom, what's wrong?

105
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,040
Keep her in line.

106
00:04:33,279 --> 00:04:34,639
Or next time, I won't hold back.

107
00:04:41,639 --> 00:04:42,199
Move.

108
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:43,960
(Su Yan.)

109
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,160
(Tell me.)

110
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,760
(What would make you feel better?)

111
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:52,160
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

112
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:55,680
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

113
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:59,200
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

114
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:02,960
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

115
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:21,440
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

116
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:25,080
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

117
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:28,280
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

118
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:31,960
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

119
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:35,360
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

120
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:39,040
♪I hum this song alone♪

121
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:42,880
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

122
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:46,960
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

123
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:50,240
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

124
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:53,840
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

125
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:57,320
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

126
00:05:57,320 --> 00:06:02,200
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
